	"changenote"		"v2.0.1-beta: Fix Road & Bridge placement by expanding ZoneManager.CheckLimits and ZoneManager.CreateBlock to 128K (eliminates 'Cannot create more zone blocks' on saves exceeding 48K), and restore environment prop/tree updating in NetSegment.UpdateZones."
